[node name="BriefingText" type="Label" parent="Overlays/BriefingOverlay/CenterContainer/Panel/Margin/VBox"]
layout_mode = 2
theme_override_colors/font_color = Color(0.85, 0.9, 0.95, 1)
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 13
text = "MISSION PARAMETERS:
• Infiltrate the 1600x900 sector and collect 12 Energy Cores to establish extraction uplink.
• Automated defense drones sweep the perimeter in 4 escalating threat waves.
• Scout Drones (Amber) pace fast corridors. Heavy Enforcers (Violet) deal 2 damage.
• Hunter Drones (Crimson) relentlessly pursue once alerted.

DISRUPTION PULSE [SPACE]:
• Emits an expanding circular EMP shockwave.
• Stuns all hostiles in radius. Stunned drones cannot move or harm you.
• Costs 25 Energy. Grab green cores, blue shield repair kits, and gold EMP overcharge cells!

CONTROLS:
• WASD / Arrow Keys: 8-Way Movement
• SPACE: Disruption Pulse
• ESC: Pause & System Configuration
• F11: Toggle Fullscreen"

